[TYPE]

Unauthorized Access Vulnerability



[DESCRIPTION]

The coocaa system has an unauthorized access vulnerability, allowing access to the backend user center without requiring an account password. When binding a new phone number, there is no need to verify the original phone number. After changing the phone number, users can retrieve their password using the new phone number on the frontend password recovery page to update their password.



